{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/sc/web_table.html?id=315-37004&api_popup=1"},"title":"国际收支平衡：金融账户","tablenote":["由于数字经四舍五入，分项总和未必与总数相等。     自2023年6月起，金融账户的整系数列已采用新的正负号常规。自此，资产／负债增加以正数值标示。注意：资产增加表示资金净流出，而负债增加则表示资金净流入。因此，金融账户差额增加（即资产减去负债为正数值）表示资金净流出。     在国际收支平衡架构下储备及非储备资产的估计数字是指交易数字。因估值方式改变（包括价格变动及汇率变动）及重新分类所导致的影响并没计算在内。","[*3] 由于数值较不显著及／或为使个别机构单位所提供的资料得以保密，数字不予公布。","@ 数字在日后会作出修订。"],"source":"政府统计处国际收支平衡统计科 (一)  (查询电话：3863 2329  查询电邮：bop@censtatd.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":316,"started":"2026-10-20T20:02:03+00:00","finished":"2026-10-20T20:02:03+00:00","durationSeconds":0.7044}},"dataSet":[{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DI","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投资","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":20806,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"资产","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":128771,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIAD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"债务工具","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":49167,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIADBtw","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"联属企业之间","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":5399,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIADDInvt","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投资企业对直接投资者","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":6562,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIADDIor","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投资者对直接投资企业","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":37206,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIAE","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"股权和投资基金份额","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":79604,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIAEE","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"除收益再投资外的股权","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":27686,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIAEEBtw","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"联属企业之间","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百万港元","figure":"","sd_value":"[*3]"},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIAEEDInvt","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投资企业